Error [E1003]: `300.0` is outside the range of `I8`
  --> tests/ui/typed_lit_float_to_int.jet:2:11
    |
  2 |     _: I8{300.0}
    |           ^^^^^
 Why: `I8` holds whole numbers from -128 through 127, and an integer typed literal never clamps
 Fix: Write a value in that range, or use `saturating(I8{value})` to clamp
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E1003
